2. SUNDIALS 7.8.0 Rust port and the rustSolveIt engine
   (fetched at setup time, NOT redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------

scripts/setup_solver.sh and scripts/setup_solver.ps1 clone the platform's
rustSolveIt repository, at the commit pinned in those scripts, into
vendor/rustSolveIt/.  vendor/ is git-ignored.  The repositories are:

  https://github.com/once-ere/rustSolveIt_Win11_SUNDIALS_7_8_0
  https://github.com/once-ere/rustSolveIt_macos-silicon_SUNDIALS_7_8_0
  https://github.com/once-ere/rustSolveIt_linux_SUNDIALS_7_8_0

Each of them vendors sundials_rs, a pure-Rust translation of SUNDIALS 7.8.0
(https://github.com/LLNL/sundials).  For Windows 11, that translation is
https://github.com/once-ere/SUNDIALS_7_8_Rust_port_for_Windows11.

None of this code is part of this repository.  The notices below travel
with it, and with any binary built from it, for example a study crate that
links sundials_core and cvode_rs and is built under target/.

