3. The original notebook  (GNU General Public License)
------------------------------------------------------

  Pair_Creation_of_Universes_WaveFunctionOfUniverse-4+4-Einstein-Lovelock-Nash.nb
  Author: Patrick L. Nash
  Licence: GNU General Public License (see LICENSE)

This Mathematica notebook is the source of the conventions that the
dirac16complex construction starts from: the gamma matrices T16^A in the
split-octonion block basis, sigma16, the metric eta4488, the Lagrangian
Lg[] and the primordial metric MatrixMetric44.  It is used unmodified.
